          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:28px;background:#ffffff;font-family:system-ui;color:#0f172a'><h1 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 26px/1.2 system-ui'>Node Template</h1><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>The Detail view above delegates to this Content node instead of holding its own content -- the same content this node presents could be reused elsewhere, or swapped out, without touching the View itself.</p><p style='margin:0;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>Every node's own presentation is this shape at minimum: a Surface off the Declaration, leading detail, then summary, then icon, ending in a Glyph.</p></div>"
        }
